blocks.en:
Across all four occupations and all values of k k , the unsteered baseline produces demographically homogeneous outputs that reflect occupational stereotypes;
Nurses and Housekeepers are consistently female-presenting or White, while Sheriffs and Construction workers are consistently male-presenting and White.
This homogeneity persists regardless of k k , confirming that the stereotyping is driven by the text prompt rather than any scene composition effect introduced by specifying multiple persons.

